window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>This collection of fantasy short stories are from the three winners of Remastered Words 2017 audio anthology, including a tale from Mark Lawrence, \"The Dream-Taker's Apprentice\", which was first published in Fantasy Faction's 2015 anthology.</p> <p>Listen to the chilling story of an antique phone before relaxing with a light take on a well-known fairy tale. Then delve into the dark future of online shopping, finally wrapping things up in a mysterious Norse world that is both magical and captivating.</p> <p>So charge your tankards, goblets and mugs, sit back and enjoy a fabled journey or two. </p>"; 
